  WrittenDialogue: "Oh there’s my hot little red head.\nI don’t think you should be saying that.\nWhat? What’s wrong?\nDidn’t you used to have like a bunch of sexual harassment complaints?\nYeah and I still do, my students are hot!\nHow does the law protect people like you??\nOh you got a problem with how I live my life!?\nI think most people would.\nOh my god, first it’s dating, then it’s pollution- next you’re gonna tell me fast food’s bad for ya!\nIt is bad for you- {1}and you should eat more of it.\nI just have a light snack of 2 whoppers every lunch and they make a whole documentary about it!\nJust one of those is an entire meal. Do you know anything about nutrition?\nNutrition? What about old-trician where you could eat raw bacon grease and it was good for ya?\nAgain, that sounds perfectly great you should always eat like that.  How old are you?\nUh 50.. {1.2}Something.\nOh that’s even better cause your risk of cardiac arrest is cut in half after 50.\nReally?\nYeah and I hear there’s an AARP MSG KFC TCBY A&W{6} promotion going on right now.\nThat sounds delicious but I need to work up an appetite.\nWhat better way to do that then to show you your generation is full of dumb bitches who can’t even solve a puzzle good!\nBeating me in a puzzle’s gonna provide commentary on why my generation’s bad?\nYou god damn right it will!"
  DialogueCharacterNames: "COACH COLBY\nARI\nCOACH COLBY\nARI\nCOACH COLBY\nARI\nCOACH COLBY\nARI\nCOACH COLBY\nARI\nCOACH COLBY\nARI\nCOACH COLBY\nARI\nCOACH COLBY\nARI\nCOACH COLBY\nARI\nCOACH COLBY\nCOACH COLBY\nARI\nCOACH COLBY"
